+<published>2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00</published>
+<summary xml:lang="en">gRPC `IpKeyExtractor` keys on client-supplied forwarding headers</summary>
+<content xml:lang="en" type="html">
+<article>
+<span class="floating-menu">
+<a href="https://github.com/RustSec/advisory-db/commits/main/crates/tokio-rate-limit/RUSTSEC-2026-0584.md">History</a> ⋅
